<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" /><title><%= title %></title><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" /><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css?v=3" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/commerce.css?v=3" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/premium.css?v=3" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/mobile.css?v=4" /><script src="/js/app.js?v=3" defer></script></head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a><%- include('partials/store-header') %><main id="main" class="page-width commerce-page"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Help & support</span></div><div class="help-layout"><section class="commerce-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CLARITY GOES A LONG WAY</p><h1>Here for the<br />whole experience.</h1><p>From finding your fit to receiving your order. Here are the details that matter.</p></section><details id="delivery" open><summary>Delivery across Bangladesh</summary><p>Delivery is ৳<%= formatPrice(settings.deliveryDhaka) %> inside Dhaka and ৳<%= formatPrice(settings.deliveryOutsideDhaka) %> outside Dhaka.<% if (Number(settings.freeDeliveryThreshold) > 0) { %> Orders from ৳<%= formatPrice(settings.freeDeliveryThreshold) %> qualify for free delivery.<% } %> Your final delivery charge appears at checkout. Our team will confirm the delivery schedule with you.</p></details><details><summary>How does cash on delivery work?</summary><p>Choose your products, enter your name, mobile number, and delivery address, then place your order. No account is required. Our team will call to confirm the details. Pay the confirmed total when your order arrives.</p></details><details><summary>Where can I track my order?</summary><p>Keep the confirmation link shown after checkout. It includes your order summary, status timeline, and printable invoice. Registered customers can also find their orders in <a class="text-link" href="/account">their account →</a>.</p></details><details id="support"><summary>Product advice, warranty, and returns</summary><p>Warranty coverage and return eligibility depend on the product and its condition. Contact our team before purchasing to confirm the terms for your chosen device. For an existing order, include your order number so we can help.</p><p><button class="text-link" data-open-support>Talk to MacPoint <span>↗</span></button></p></details><details><summary>Need a hand choosing?</summary><p>Tell us what you use your device for, your preferred configuration, and your budget. We’ll help you compare the available options. Reach us at <a href="mailto:<%= settings.supportEmail %>"><%= settings.supportEmail %></a> or use the support chat.</p></details></div></main><%- include('partials/store-footer') %><%- include('partials/store-overlays') %></body></html>
